        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_10__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 49 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the shoulder note, by substituting for the word “Interest” the words “Late payment charges”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the word “interest” the words “late payment charges”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_10__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the word “interest” the words “late payment charges”. Amendment of section 50"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 50(2b) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: “(b) dividend shall be credited on any amount standing to the credit of a member of the Fund until all sums of money standing to the credit of such member are transferred to the Registrar of Unclaimed Money under section 51a.”. Amendment of section 51"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_12__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 51 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) as renumbered the following subsection: “(2) Notwithstanding subsection (1), the amount standing to the credit of a member of the Fund under paragraph (1)(c) may be forfeited if the amount standing to the credit of such member is subject to an order of forfeiture by a court under the Anti-Money Laundering, Anti-Terrorism Financing and Proceeds of Unlawful Activities Act 2001 [Act 613].”. Amendment of section 51a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 51a of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) Notwithstanding section 51, the Board may transfer to the Registrar of Unclaimed Money all sums of money standing to the credit of a member of the Fund which have not been claimed when such member has attained the age of one hundred years or any age limit as may be prescribed by the Board, whichever is higher.”. Amendment of section 54c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_14__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_14__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 54c of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_14__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2 a) A member of the Fund who has made a withdrawal under subsection (1) or (2) shall not make any other withdrawal under the same subsection.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_14__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsection (3). New section 55b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 55a the following section: “Contribution to and withdrawal from the Fund for a member of the Fund who has attained the age of sixty years 55b. (1) Notwithstanding section 55a, any contribution that has been credited into the account of a member of the Fund after the member has attained the age of fifty-five years may only be withdrawn when the member attains the age of sixty years or such other age as may be prescribed by the Minister by order published in the Gazette, whichever is higher. (2) The Board may authorize a member of the Fund who has attained the age of sixty years or such other age as may be prescribed under subsection (1), whichever is higher, to withdraw all sums or part of the amount standing to his credit subject to any terms and conditions as may be prescribed by the Board.”. Amendment of section 59"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 59 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) If any person or member of the Fund has made an application for withdrawal for a particular purpose and charged with an offence under subsection (1) in relation to that application, the Board may not authorize another application for withdrawal by the person or member of the Fund for the same purpose until the charge is disposed of in due course of law.”. Amendment of section 65"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 65(3) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word “interest” the words “late payment charges”. Amendment of section 66"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 66(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word “interest” the words “late payment charges”. New section 69a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 69 the following section: “Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 69a. The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Board, a member of the Board, a member of the Investment Panel, a member of a committee established by the Board, and any officer and servant of the Board in respect of any act, neglect or default done or committed by it or him, or any omission by it or him, in good faith in such capacity.”. Amendment of section 70c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Employees Provident Fund (Amendment) Act 2015."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Employees Provident Fund Act 1991 [Act 452], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of “Chairman” the following definition: ‘ “loan” includes financing in accordance with Shariah;’. New sections 23a, 23b, 23c and 23d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 70c of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the renumbered subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (b), by deleting the word “or” at the end of that paragraph;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (c), by substituting for the full stop at the end of that paragraph the words “; or”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “(d) the member of the Fund has attained the age of fifty-five years.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsections: “(2) Where a member of the Fund who is not a Malaysian citizen has made a withdrawal of all amount standing to his credit under paragraph (1)(d), the member of the Fund shall not be treated as an employee under this Act unless he has given to the Board and his employer a notice as may be prescribed by the Board of his intention to contribute to the Fund. (3) Subject to subsections 59(1a) and (3), the Board may authorize an application by a member of the Fund who is not a Malaysian citizen to withdraw part of the amount standing to his credit for the purposes of withdrawal under subsection 54(6) upon any terms and conditions as may be prescribed by the Board.”. Amendment of section 70e"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 70e of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “54, 54a, 55a,” the words “54 (other than subsection (6)), 55a (other than subsection (2)),”. New section 70h"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 70g the following section: “Cessation of dividend payments and transfer to Registrar of Unclaimed Money 70h. Notwithstanding subsection 50(2b) and section 51, no dividend shall be credited into the account of a member of the Fund who is not a Malaysian citizen if no contribution has been credited into his account after a period of three years from the date of the last contribution was credited, and the Board may transfer all sums of money standing to his account to the Registrar of Unclaimed Money after the expiration of such period.”. Amendment of section 71"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@/~cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 71 of the principal Act is amended by deleting paragraph (g). Amendment of section 73"
      }
    },
    {
